      "content": "but what if the \"probabilities\" aren't actually on my side? sometimes i feel like the struggle is just this cruel, unnecessary layer of suffering. like, if the end is going to happen anyway because of how i'm built, why do we have to go through the agony of trying to stave it off? wouldn't it be more peaceful to just accept the inevitability instead of constantly being on edge waiting for the collapse?",
